> cmavo can't form tanru. It's identical in meaning if you remove {cu} 
> and I think it is more aesthetically pleasing that way.

Slight correction: TAGs(sumtcita; e.g. tenses and BAI) cannot form 
tanru. There are many cmavo that can, however. ke, ke'e, bo and all of 
NAhE being the most common, not to mention attitudinals.
ze'e is a tense though, and can not form a tanru. The {cu} can be elided.

